      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The skillful use of nerve blocks is important as a diagnostic, prognostic, and therapeutic tool in the management of chronic and acute pain problems. It is important that these blocks be performed not as technical exercises, but with responsibility, skill, and understanding--and in collaboration with both the patient and fellow physicians, so as to minimize or avoid harmful side effects and give the earliest possible relief from suffering."},
